# SH-GNN: Spherical Harmonic Graph Neural Network

**Production‑ready deep learning framework with strict SO(3) equivariance and physical constraints.**

SH-GNN compiles physics directly into the network architecture. It guarantees rotational equivariance without data augmentation, adaptively truncates high frequencies via dynamic sparsity, and enforces physical laws through a novel physics‑informed loss.

